# golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained and unsafe by design. The
# advisory has no fixed version — the remediation is to not import the
# package, which this project does not: x/crypto is a transitive dependency
# and only curve25519, ed25519, and pbkdf2 are in the build graph (confirmed
# via `go list -deps ./...`). Upgrading x/crypto will never clear this.
GO-2026-5932
